@TodoApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5248

GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Create a task
POST {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "Prepare API demo",
	"description": "Create a task to verify the successful request path.",
	"isCompleted": false,
	"dueDate": "2026-10-25T12:00:00"
}

### Invalid request: title is empty and dueDate is missing; expect 400
POST {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "",
	"description": "This request should fail validation.",
	"isCompleted": false
}
